-- One-off data migration: moves the 40 static tasks from src/lib/data.ts /
-- server/src/tokens.ts into dev_challenges, using the exact same ids so
-- every existing completion/post/suggestion reference keeps resolving via
-- resolveBaseCatalogEntry (see server/src/catalog.ts). See
-- docs/task-database-roadmap.md Phase 3.
--
-- Text (title/desc) is taken from src/lib/data.ts, not the
-- server/src/tokens.ts mirror: a diff found the two had drifted on ~29 of
-- 40 desc fields, all the same shape (tokens.ts had picked up em dashes
-- that data.ts never had) — data.ts's text is both the one users already
-- see today and the one compliant with AGENTS.md's "no em dashes in
-- challenge titles/descriptions" rule. No other field (tokens, cadence,
-- cat, verify, proofType, streakTarget) differed between the two copies.
--
-- guide_checklist and verifiability_notes are deliberately left NULL /
-- flagged, not backfilled as "passing" — these 40 predate the five-test
-- guide and have not been re-reviewed against it as part of this
-- mechanical migration. Do not treat their presence here as a quality
-- endorsement.

